! _POC-XRL2VPN RT02(IOL 17.15)= IOS XE の PE。L2VPN(疑似回線・VPLS・EVPN が通るか)は PoC の段で足す。
mpls label protocol ldp
mpls ldp router-id Loopback0 force
mpls ldp discovery targeted-hello accept
!
interface Loopback0
 ip address 10.255.0.12 255.255.255.255
 ip router isis CORE
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description CORE-A to RT01
 ip address 10.0.12.12 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 isis metric 10
 mpls ip
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[1] }}
 description CORE-B to RT03
 ip address 10.0.23.12 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 isis metric 100
 mpls ip
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[2] }}
 description CE2
 no ip address
 no shutdown
!
router isis CORE
 net 49.0001.0100.0000.0012.00
 is-type level-2-only
 metric-style wide
 log-adjacency-changes
 mpls ldp sync
!
